      "typical_award_size": "HCD formula allocations to the County: $189,817 (2024) and $204,647 (2025), estimated $1,186,356 for 2024-2028; the County's five-year plan activities were not located in Board records (Ukiah and Fort Bragg hold their own allocations, and Fort Bragg applied to the 2024 competitive non-entitlement PLHA round for rental assistance).",
