      "funding_type": "rental assistance",
      "typical_award_size": "CDC administers about 750 Housing Choice Vouchers, about 136 Permanent Supportive Housing vouchers (Coordinated Entry referrals), VASH, FUP and Mainstream vouchers, and project-based vouchers at Sun House, Ukiah (10 one-bedroom units for senior veterans via the VA), The Plateau, Fort Bragg (20 PSH units in a 69-unit Danco development, the most recent PBV award) and Orr Creek Commons, Ukiah (RCHDC). Administrative Plan Chapter XXI (adopted May 15, 2025) allows project-basing up to 20% of budget authority with selection by competitive RFP or without a new competition for projects already selected through LIHTC or HOME competitions within three years.",
